WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.839
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.840 --> 01:59.479
(One day earlier)

01:59.480 --> 02:03.360
(Demon-Sealing Pagoda, Shu Mountain)

02:15.280 --> 02:16.840
(Qing Wei, Shu Mountain)

02:17.140 --> 02:18.180
Demon-Sealing Pagoda!

02:20.460 --> 02:21.939
The barrier's been breached.

02:21.940 --> 02:23.740
Elders, please hurry back
to the Wuji Pavilion.

02:26.240 --> 02:30.200
(Demon Sword)

02:49.140 --> 02:51.359
This is bad! The demons inside
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda have escaped!

02:51.360 --> 02:52.259
- We can't let them get away!
- The elders are here!

02:52.260 --> 02:54.460
What kind of demon

02:54.660 --> 02:56.619
could break through
the Five Elements Array?

02:56.620 --> 02:57.719
(Shu Mountain Elders: Jing Ming,
He Yang, You Xuan, Cang Gu)

02:57.720 --> 03:00.059
If the demons escape,

03:00.060 --> 03:01.860
the mortal realm will be in danger.

03:02.020 --> 03:03.419
Fellow elders,

03:03.420 --> 03:06.059
let's reforge the Five Element Array

03:06.060 --> 03:08.460
and reseal the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.

03:17.180 --> 03:19.939
Ha ha ha!

03:19.940 --> 03:22.100
I'm finally free!

03:25.700 --> 03:28.000
You darn Shu Mountain Taoist priests!

03:28.060 --> 03:29.939
I won't let this go!

03:29.940 --> 03:32.380
Just wait.

03:33.080 --> 03:36.840
=Episode 2=
=The Bamboo Grove Pact=

03:47.220 --> 03:48.220
Jing Tian!

03:48.380 --> 03:49.889
You brat,

03:49.890 --> 03:52.339
all you know is to slack off!

03:52.340 --> 03:54.209
You come back only after closing time.

03:54.210 --> 03:55.139
Listen to me.

03:55.140 --> 03:57.179
I ran into demons.

03:57.180 --> 03:58.260
From what I see,

03:58.380 --> 03:59.660
you're the demon

03:59.820 --> 04:01.299
causing trouble!

04:01.300 --> 04:03.139
I really did meet demons!

04:03.140 --> 04:04.300
I...

04:18.340 --> 04:19.620
Pawn the sword.

04:19.940 --> 04:20.659
Jing Tian,

04:20.660 --> 04:22.420
serve the customer.

04:23.740 --> 04:26.500
Sir, may I ask your name?

04:26.780 --> 04:28.060
Chong Lou.

04:28.950 --> 04:29.679
Boss.

04:29.680 --> 04:30.390
Uh.

04:31.020 --> 04:32.139
Jing Tian.

04:32.140 --> 04:32.619
Ah?

04:32.620 --> 04:35.099
Don't forget to charge him
for the broken floor tiles.

04:35.100 --> 04:36.820
If not, just patch them up.

04:39.260 --> 04:40.380
Fine.

04:41.860 --> 04:44.300
(This is a fine ancient sword.)

04:45.220 --> 04:47.099
(But judging by his attitude,)

04:47.100 --> 04:48.699
(it won't come cheap.)

04:48.700 --> 04:49.459
(Hmph!)

04:49.460 --> 04:51.220
(I'll take him down a notch.)

04:51.660 --> 04:52.780
Ahem.

04:53.860 --> 04:57.419
There's no inscription on this sword.

04:57.420 --> 04:58.099
Well.

04:58.100 --> 05:00.300
It's hard to tell what it's worth.

05:00.460 --> 05:03.020
How much would you like
to pawn it for, sir?

05:04.140 --> 05:05.779
(Twenty taels at most.)

05:05.780 --> 05:06.699
One coin.

05:06.700 --> 05:07.860
One coin?

05:08.300 --> 05:09.299
Hmm.

05:09.300 --> 05:10.420
Are you serious?

05:11.180 --> 05:12.300
Hmm.

05:12.620 --> 05:13.939
Don't regret it.

05:13.940 --> 05:14.699
Wait.

05:14.700 --> 05:16.260
I'll write up the pawn ticket.

05:18.860 --> 05:21.139
(Yong'an Pawnshop)
Please press your thumbprint here

05:21.140 --> 05:22.579
and fill in these details.

05:22.580 --> 05:24.740
I'll prepare some papers.

05:26.780 --> 05:29.300
(How did you end up like this?)

05:30.080 --> 05:34.960
(Chong Lou)

05:37.540 --> 05:38.660
Please wait.

05:40.660 --> 05:41.780
Sir,

05:42.060 --> 05:43.820
your one coin.

05:45.240 --> 05:47.000
(Yong'an Pawnshop)

05:57.770 --> 05:59.299
Chong Lou?

05:59.300 --> 06:00.420
Eh?

06:02.690 --> 06:04.140
(Where did he go?)

06:09.110 --> 06:12.860
Why didn't he note if it was redeemable
or an outright sale, or the pawn term?

06:14.260 --> 06:15.379
Well.

06:15.380 --> 06:17.410
We'll deal with it
when he comes back to redeem it.

06:20.400 --> 06:22.739
(Outside the city,
Southwest Bamboo Grove)

06:22.740 --> 06:24.460
Your name is Hua Ying?

06:25.780 --> 06:26.900
What?

06:26.980 --> 06:29.340
I'm the first person
who can understand you?

06:30.100 --> 06:32.420
Then we must be fated to be friends.

06:33.700 --> 06:35.740
You can neutralize all poisons?

06:35.820 --> 06:37.140
That's amazing!

06:40.100 --> 06:41.260
Great!

06:42.740 --> 06:44.019
That Emei Piercer?

06:44.020 --> 06:45.059
It's fine.

06:45.060 --> 06:47.860
That's my home.
I'll go get it myself. Don't worry.

06:48.820 --> 06:49.659
Wait.

06:49.660 --> 06:51.139
It's getting late.

06:51.140 --> 06:53.260
Why hasn't Jing Tian shown up yet?

06:54.660 --> 06:56.380
A strange man

06:56.580 --> 06:58.220
and a strange sword.

06:59.740 --> 07:01.720
What's their deal?

07:04.180 --> 07:05.300
What is this?

07:05.980 --> 07:07.100
Who did this?

07:12.919 --> 07:14.020
Ah?

07:24.830 --> 07:26.940
That's weird.

07:27.140 --> 07:29.780
Didn't I just lock it up?

07:45.340 --> 07:48.020
A ghost! It's a ghost!

07:50.140 --> 07:51.059
Help!

07:51.060 --> 07:52.300
Help!

07:53.060 --> 07:54.180
Help me!

07:54.830 --> 07:56.159
Help me!

07:56.160 --> 07:57.060
Hua Ying!

08:09.430 --> 08:10.860
I was waiting for him.

08:11.180 --> 08:12.300
Hua Ying,

08:12.470 --> 08:13.740
do me a favor.

08:13.850 --> 08:15.340
Neutralize his poison.

08:18.900 --> 08:20.020
What?

08:20.220 --> 08:21.980
You're saying the poison is too weak.

08:22.100 --> 08:23.940
Sweating it out will do?

08:30.060 --> 08:31.459
Hey, you.

08:31.460 --> 08:35.579
You were this close to dying
from poison just now.

08:35.580 --> 08:36.699
Here.

08:36.700 --> 08:39.620
Take my antidote pill.

08:41.030 --> 08:41.980
Hmm?

08:42.860 --> 08:46.209
Why does it taste like oranges?

08:46.210 --> 08:48.420
Sweet and sour. Yummy.

08:49.690 --> 08:51.510
Watch out! There's a demon behind you!

08:52.660 --> 08:54.019
What demon?

08:54.020 --> 08:55.460
It's called Hua Ying.

08:55.480 --> 08:57.209
It's a treasured beast
of the Tang family.

08:57.210 --> 08:58.880
Five Poison Immortal Beast.

08:59.740 --> 09:01.260
What five yummy beasts?

09:02.310 --> 09:03.019
No.

09:03.020 --> 09:05.140
I think it looks more like a turnip.

09:06.300 --> 09:07.100
You!

09:07.300 --> 09:08.740
You are a turnip!

09:08.820 --> 09:10.380
Hua Ying is my friend.

09:10.580 --> 09:11.340
Wait.

09:11.930 --> 09:13.819
What's with the sword behind you?

09:13.820 --> 09:14.459
Sword?

09:14.460 --> 09:15.020
Eh?

09:22.560 --> 09:24.170
This sword.

09:24.370 --> 09:25.500
Um.

09:25.620 --> 09:26.379
Anyway,

09:26.380 --> 09:27.980
someone gave it to me.

09:30.220 --> 09:33.020
(What? This sword is powerful?)

09:33.500 --> 09:35.540
(And it chose him as its master?)

09:35.780 --> 09:37.059
I didn't know

09:37.060 --> 09:39.180
you had some skill.

09:40.140 --> 09:41.139
Well.

09:41.140 --> 09:42.820
I'll make an exception.

09:43.020 --> 09:44.580
You can serve as my sidekick

09:44.700 --> 09:46.220
and return with me
to the Tang Family Fort

09:46.260 --> 09:47.379
for an important task.

09:47.380 --> 09:48.659
Important task?

09:48.660 --> 09:50.019
Did you break something again?

09:50.020 --> 09:51.220
Don't talk nonsense.

09:52.140 --> 09:53.740
Fine, I'll tell you.

09:54.380 --> 09:56.579
Someone's trying to harm the Tang Clan.

09:56.580 --> 09:58.060
We're going to uphold justice.

09:58.500 --> 09:59.459
Seriously?

09:59.460 --> 10:01.780
Uphold justice?

10:02.620 --> 10:03.739
Hey.

10:03.740 --> 10:05.340
I have the right to order you around.

10:05.620 --> 10:06.780
Besides,

10:06.820 --> 10:08.379
you know Tang Family Fort

10:08.380 --> 10:12.099
is the largest sect in Yuzhou City.

10:12.100 --> 10:15.820
If you do well, I'll give you
wealth and glory for life.

10:16.340 --> 10:18.260
Don't be ungrateful.

10:19.820 --> 10:20.939
Alright.

10:20.940 --> 10:23.219
But you'll have to pay
the commission first.

10:23.220 --> 10:23.859
You see,

10:23.860 --> 10:25.219
let me make myself clear.

10:25.220 --> 10:27.060
I'm not taking advantage.

10:27.980 --> 10:30.219
It's because I skipped work today,

10:30.220 --> 10:32.180
and Zhao Wenchang wanted to dock my pay.

10:32.940 --> 10:34.820
I left in a hurry
and didn't bring any money.

10:35.380 --> 10:36.600
I'll leave this with you for now.

10:36.600 --> 10:37.459
(Tang)

10:37.460 --> 10:38.580
Ah?

10:39.180 --> 10:40.460
This...

10:40.780 --> 10:42.340
This is your token.

10:42.620 --> 10:43.019
Uh.

10:43.020 --> 10:44.660
After I get the money,

10:44.700 --> 10:46.540
you can return it to me later.

10:47.060 --> 10:48.699
I'll put it in writing.

10:48.700 --> 10:49.979
Stop dilly-dallying.

10:49.980 --> 10:51.020
Let's go.

10:51.700 --> 10:52.700
Alright.

10:53.340 --> 10:54.460
Stand right there.

10:55.140 --> 10:57.580
Isn't this Miss Tang?

10:57.740 --> 10:59.099
Hand her over to Tang Yi.

10:59.100 --> 11:01.220
We'll split the bounty between us.

11:02.220 --> 11:04.699
Aren't they Thunder Hall's hired muscle?
Your enemies?

11:04.700 --> 11:06.019
(Oh no, my weapon.)

11:06.020 --> 11:08.100
They outnumbered us. Run.

11:09.500 --> 11:10.860
It's dangerous here.

11:10.980 --> 11:12.219
You go first.

11:12.220 --> 11:12.859
Get them!

11:12.860 --> 11:13.779
- Yes!
- Yes!

11:13.780 --> 11:14.900
Careful!

11:46.920 --> 11:48.090
Amazing!

11:50.380 --> 11:52.500
This brat.

11:54.220 --> 11:55.420
This sword.

11:56.180 --> 11:56.979
Well?

11:56.980 --> 11:57.699
Scared now?

11:57.700 --> 11:59.939
What do you want?
Don't do anything reckless.

11:59.940 --> 12:00.900
I...

12:01.540 --> 12:02.660
I want...

12:03.380 --> 12:04.500
I want...

12:06.860 --> 12:07.859
What's wrong?

12:07.860 --> 12:08.819
Wake up.

12:08.820 --> 12:09.940
Wake up.

12:10.900 --> 12:12.540
Why did he suddenly faint?

12:12.660 --> 12:14.020
Enough of your nonsense.

12:15.020 --> 12:16.140
Stay still.

12:18.540 --> 12:20.339
(Hua Ying, don't come out.)

12:20.340 --> 12:21.460
(Don't make a sound.)

12:23.220 --> 12:25.340
Tch. You scared me.

12:28.100 --> 12:29.220
Whoa.

12:29.540 --> 12:30.899
This sword is insanely heavy.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.059
I can't lift it.

12:32.060 --> 12:32.859
Forget it.

12:32.860 --> 12:33.709
Just leave it here.

12:33.710 --> 12:36.259
If we take Miss Tang back,
that's a huge merit.

12:36.260 --> 12:37.379
What about that brat?

12:37.380 --> 12:38.349
Take him too.

12:38.350 --> 12:39.360
Yes.

12:54.090 --> 12:56.080
My hands feel numb.

12:57.500 --> 12:58.620
I'm sorry.

12:59.010 --> 13:00.410
I dragged you into this.

13:01.540 --> 13:05.180
Are you feeling guilty enough
to pay me extra?

13:05.260 --> 13:06.620
Save the jokes.

13:06.860 --> 13:08.739
I'll find a way to knock them out

13:08.740 --> 13:09.979
and hold them off.

13:09.980 --> 13:11.180
You'll run.

13:11.780 --> 13:12.539
Ah?

13:12.540 --> 13:13.780
What about you?

13:17.020 --> 13:18.140
Hua Ying.

13:18.980 --> 13:20.860
You brought my Emei Piercer too.

13:20.900 --> 13:22.300
The sword is here too.

13:26.300 --> 13:27.500
Thank you, Hua Ying.

13:30.220 --> 13:32.540
We'd better leave now, or they'll spot us.

13:34.580 --> 13:35.700
Let's go.

13:35.800 --> 13:36.149
Let's go.

13:36.150 --> 13:37.620
Its head is incredibly hard.

13:39.180 --> 13:41.540
Someone get over here! They got away!

13:42.300 --> 13:44.460
They went that way! After them!

13:46.260 --> 13:47.940
Oh no! There's no road ahead.

13:48.300 --> 13:49.740
Where are we?

13:50.180 --> 13:51.420
Looks like

13:51.480 --> 13:53.270
(Great River Crossing)
the Great River Crossing.

13:55.940 --> 13:57.060
Come on, run.

13:57.180 --> 13:58.740
Let's see where you think you're going.

13:59.500 --> 14:00.620
Xuejian,

14:00.940 --> 14:03.140
I've finally found you.

14:03.180 --> 14:05.220
Hand over
the Five Poison Immortal Beast.

14:05.860 --> 14:06.899
Not a chance.

14:06.900 --> 14:10.100
I'll tell Grandpa how you betrayed
the Tang family, Seventh Uncle.

14:11.860 --> 14:13.419
Who would believe you?

14:13.420 --> 14:14.820
Who is he?

14:15.100 --> 14:16.220
Get them!

14:16.660 --> 14:17.420
Look out!

14:17.780 --> 14:19.180
It's fire weapons from Thunder Hall.

14:38.220 --> 14:39.140
Hua Ying!

14:45.860 --> 14:46.739
What do we do?

14:46.740 --> 14:48.140
He took Hua Ying.

14:48.940 --> 14:50.420
We'll deal with these first.

14:54.420 --> 14:55.780
Again?

15:11.260 --> 15:12.380
Jing Tian.

15:25.340 --> 15:26.460
What is that?

15:27.380 --> 15:28.500
Watch out!

15:36.740 --> 15:37.740
Xuejian!

15:51.960 --> 15:54.760
(Afterimage Sword)

15:59.180 --> 16:00.940
(What was that move?)

16:03.500 --> 16:05.180
Are you all right, Xuejian?

16:05.340 --> 16:06.740
I can't move.

16:08.740 --> 16:09.900
You should go now.

16:10.300 --> 16:11.740
Don't think about driving me away.

16:11.820 --> 16:13.300
I took your token.

16:13.660 --> 16:14.980
My job isn't done yet.

16:22.580 --> 16:23.700
Jing Tian.

16:39.020 --> 16:39.829
You demon,

16:39.830 --> 16:41.320
(Xu Changqing)
enough of your arrogance!

17:05.260 --> 17:06.940
Ouch!

17:10.260 --> 17:11.660
Miss Tang.

17:11.860 --> 17:13.100
Easy, please.

17:17.460 --> 17:18.980
It's just superficial.

17:19.060 --> 17:20.700
Why are you screaming?

17:21.820 --> 17:22.940
It's done.

17:23.180 --> 17:24.500
Get dressed.

17:34.660 --> 17:35.939
I didn't expect

17:35.940 --> 17:39.180
upholding justice to be this hard.

17:44.880 --> 17:48.099
(Zi Xuan)

17:48.100 --> 17:49.299
Zi Xuan.

17:49.300 --> 17:50.339
Xuejian.

17:50.340 --> 17:51.580
Changqing.

17:51.940 --> 17:53.060
Mm.

17:53.420 --> 17:55.099
Are you all right now?

17:55.100 --> 17:55.859
Yes.

17:55.860 --> 17:57.259
Thanks to you, Zi Xuan.

17:57.260 --> 17:59.460
I'm out and about.

18:00.340 --> 18:01.460
Jing Tian,

18:01.500 --> 18:03.099
they saved us
at the Great River Crossing.

18:03.100 --> 18:07.460
This is Xu Changqing
and his fiancée, Zi Xuan.

18:08.420 --> 18:10.700
Xu is a disciple of Shu Mountain.

18:11.340 --> 18:12.459
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

18:12.460 --> 18:14.699
I've admired the heroes of Shu Mountain
since I was a kid.

18:14.700 --> 18:15.820
You flatter me.

18:16.130 --> 18:17.940
I've been cast out of the sect.

18:20.340 --> 18:22.740
(Isn't this the sword from
atop the Demon-Sealing Pagoda?)

18:25.940 --> 18:27.060
Young man,

18:27.260 --> 18:28.659
I have a few questions for you.

18:28.660 --> 18:29.699
Sure.

18:29.700 --> 18:32.300
Where did you get this sword?

18:32.540 --> 18:33.539
Oh, this?

18:33.540 --> 18:35.620
A strange customer pawned it to me.

18:35.740 --> 18:37.699
It may look huge and heavy,

18:37.700 --> 18:40.740
but when I swing it, it feels
as light as a wooden sword.

18:42.540 --> 18:43.860
Don't swing it here.

18:47.540 --> 18:48.780
Right.

18:49.020 --> 18:50.739
Sit down.

18:50.740 --> 18:52.140
Don't move around.

18:54.060 --> 18:56.420
(The power of this sword is terrifying.)

18:56.500 --> 18:58.140
(Even I can barely withstand it,)

18:58.460 --> 19:00.580
(yet an ordinary man like him
can wield it.)

19:00.820 --> 19:01.940
Young man,

19:02.420 --> 19:04.659
this is a demon sword
driven by ghostly force.

19:04.660 --> 19:06.420
You have no foundation
in inner cultivation.

19:06.540 --> 19:07.899
If you keep carrying it,

19:07.900 --> 19:09.660
you'll be exhausted and pass out.

19:09.710 --> 19:12.440
At worst, it'll damage your meridians
or even cost you your life.

19:12.500 --> 19:13.620
What?

19:13.700 --> 19:14.779
What should we do?

19:14.780 --> 19:15.900
Maybe

19:15.940 --> 19:17.420
you should throw it away.

19:17.430 --> 19:18.350
Uh.

19:19.260 --> 19:20.500
I can't.

19:20.540 --> 19:22.459
It's saved us more than once.

19:22.460 --> 19:23.660
Besides,

19:23.740 --> 19:24.699
it's a pawned item.

19:24.700 --> 19:26.580
The owner will come back for it.

19:28.060 --> 19:30.059
(Though this goes against
Shu Mountain's rules,)

19:30.060 --> 19:31.700
(it's for saving a life.)

19:32.060 --> 19:33.980
(I believe Master will agree.)

19:34.860 --> 19:35.939
How about this?

19:35.940 --> 19:38.580
I'll teach you basic
inner cultivation techniques.

19:38.580 --> 19:40.640
They can suppress the demonic energy
and keep you alive.

19:40.640 --> 19:41.740
Really?

19:41.820 --> 19:42.779
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

19:42.780 --> 19:43.659
No.

19:43.660 --> 19:44.859
Thank you, Master.

19:44.860 --> 19:46.299
Please accept my respects.

19:46.300 --> 19:47.179
Young man,

19:47.180 --> 19:48.300
that won't do.

19:48.500 --> 19:49.819
If you don't mind,

19:49.820 --> 19:51.419
we can be friends.

19:51.420 --> 19:52.940
Call me Changqing.

19:56.180 --> 19:57.660
I was too forward.

19:58.460 --> 19:59.379
Changqing,

19:59.380 --> 20:00.900
you can call me Tian.

20:02.060 --> 20:02.860
Mm.

20:03.060 --> 20:04.139
Xuejian,

20:04.140 --> 20:05.099
come with me.

20:05.100 --> 20:06.060
Mm.

20:07.780 --> 20:08.900
Tian,

20:09.020 --> 20:10.500
pay attention to

20:10.580 --> 20:12.019
what I'm about to say.

20:12.020 --> 20:12.939
Yes.

20:12.940 --> 20:14.220
Close your eyes.

20:14.620 --> 20:16.100
The sword is made of ordinary steel,

20:16.260 --> 20:18.020
but gains sentience
through its wielder,

20:18.100 --> 20:19.540
moves by intent,

20:19.580 --> 20:21.100
and awakens through blood.

20:22.140 --> 20:26.260
Now, circulate your inner energy
as I instruct you.

20:39.750 --> 20:41.029
Unite sword and qi,

20:41.030 --> 20:42.500
ride the sword and soar.

20:42.750 --> 20:43.650
Rise!

20:45.200 --> 20:46.430
It worked!

20:47.420 --> 20:48.590
Jing Tian!

21:09.790 --> 21:13.069
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

21:13.070 --> 21:16.399
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

21:16.400 --> 21:20.049
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

21:20.050 --> 21:23.269
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

21:23.270 --> 21:26.439
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

21:26.440 --> 21:30.089
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

21:30.090 --> 21:33.819
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

21:33.820 --> 21:40.319
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

21:40.320 --> 21:43.769
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

21:43.770 --> 21:47.259
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

21:47.260 --> 21:50.649
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

21:50.650 --> 21:54.049
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:54.050 --> 21:57.439
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:57.440 --> 22:00.959
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

22:00.960 --> 22:04.289
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

22:04.290 --> 22:07.629
♪All for the sake of the living♪

22:07.630 --> 22:12.440
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

22:26.140 --> 22:27.579
I dreamed of you again.

22:27.580 --> 22:36.179
(Next episode preview)

22:36.180 --> 22:37.730
Have you made up your mind?

22:38.260 --> 22:41.419
If the poison inside Xuejian
can't be removed, you're doomed.

22:41.420 --> 22:42.770
I believe in her.

22:44.340 --> 22:46.770
You're as lucky as ever.

22:46.780 --> 22:48.250
You found yourself a fool.

22:48.500 --> 22:51.290
Stop wasting time. Begin now.
